        "trigger": "Opens the app with no medications",
        "mermaid": "flowchart TD\n  A[Today: empty state] --> B[Add medication]\n  B --> C{Name, dose and a time entered?}\n  C -->|No| D[Show what is missing] --> B\n  C -->|Yes| E[Save medication]\n  E --> F{Saved?}\n  F -->|No| G[Keep entries and offer Try again] --> E\n  F -->|Yes| H[Today shows the new doses]",
        "screens": [
